author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "Every declared measurement retains an append-only series of observations with the commit and the timestamp that produced each, not just the current ceiling and a measured_on date; A read surface answers 'how has this population moved since it was filed' without replaying git history by hand; The series is derived from recorded observations, never hand-edited, and survives compaction; The existing ratchet keeps failing on growth; the ledger adds the falling half of the signal"
